sequenceDiagram
 participant A as Actor/client
 participant R as Router
 participant I as Identity provider
 participant Z as Authorization service
 participant S as Domain service
 A->>R: Request
 R->>I: Authenticate/session/token
 I-->>R: Identity or failure
 R->>Z: Check route/model/record permissions
 Z-->>R: Allow or deny
 R->>S: Authorized operation
 S-->>R: Result/error
 R-->>A: Response
